    <summary>ZenTao PMS CLI and Go SDK for AI coding agents and modern developers</summary>
    <description>ZenTao PMS (ZenTao) CLI tool and Go SDK designed for AI coding agents (Claude Code, ZCode, Cursor, OpenHands) and modern developers.

Key Features:
- Zero-Auth Persistent Sessions: Single login via system keychain with transparent session auto-refresh when server sessions expire.
- Full Workbench Support: Complete coverage for personal tasks, assigned bugs, todos, stories, projects, products, and activity dynamics.
- Agent-Ready Structured Output: Unified JSON envelopes, ASCII tables, and deterministic exit codes.
- Universal ZenTao Version Compatibility: Direct alignment with ZenTao native web controllers and PHP SDK across legacy and modern versions.
    </description>
